# NeuroBase Environment Variables

# Supabase Configuration (get from https://supabase.com)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGc...

# Hugging Face API Key (optional - get from https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens)
VITE_HF_API_KEY=hf_...

# ⚠️ IMPORTANT SECURITY NOTES:
# 1. Copy this file to .env and fill in your ACTUAL keys
# 2. .env is in .gitignore - it will NEVER be committed
# 3. This .env.example file IS safe to commit (no real keys)
# 4. Keep your real .env file private and never share the keys
# 5. If keys are exposed, regenerate them immediately on their platforms
